      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Methodist Church, founded in 1876, survived the 1899 tornado intact, while the Zion Baptist Church was rebuilt in 1901 and merged into the Herman Federated Church.",
